# Release signing private keys. These must never be committed: the matching
# public key is embedded in Services/ReleaseSignature.cs, and the private key
# belongs in the protected "release" GitHub environment.
release-keys/*.key
release-keys/*.key.b64
release-keys/*.pem
release-keys/*.der
